{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore time and space as you learn about astronomy and earn stars to buy overlays for the Earth and Sun and control the passage of time. Soon you will be able to simulate and observe Earth/Sun correspondences from any age and perspective as you use keyboard and mouse controls to fly through space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through time.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlay graphics on the Earth and Sun.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust scene visuals like lighting and post effects. \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change vantage point </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/bc1081ec02371b52384dd48ae0368812.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/bc1081ec02371b52384dd48ae0368812.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/bc1081ec02371b52384dd48ae0368812.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reckon and Cipher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlay graphics on the Earth and Sun enabling quick identification of cosmic and achronic conjunctions and oppositions between the Earth, Sun, and signs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/7fd1721282ecbec1a1505e0def173d8d.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/7fd1721282ecbec1a1505e0def173d8d.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/7fd1721282ecbec1a1505e0def173d8d.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POV</strong>\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move to predefined vantage points to observe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5f3dfcebe30428fc6a1559d9cac7024b.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5f3dfcebe30428fc6a1559d9cac7024b.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5f3dfcebe30428fc6a1559d9cac7024b.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warp Away</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the Earth in an instant. Jump directly to the Vernal Equinox, the Summer Solstice, the Autumnal Equinox, or the Winter Solstice with a single click. Span the millennia with equal ease and jump to any age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/2e6ae304f4fa2b1bf3fc4fe514cfa9f3.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/2e6ae304f4fa2b1bf3fc4fe514cfa9f3.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/2e6ae304f4fa2b1bf3fc4fe514cfa9f3.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lever of Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag a slider to speed up time. Make the days fly by. Months in a moment. The Earth spins around the sun and years turn into centuries, then you can see the Precession of the Equinoxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/e54c35312621102026397a8c59972f83.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/e54c35312621102026397a8c59972f83.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/e54c35312621102026397a8c59972f83.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard and mouse to fly a spaceship to find your own perfect perch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/67450d33cc9b2a5a427ffe18bdba5e33.poster.avif?t=1763516397\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/67450d33cc9b2a5a427ffe18bdba5e33.webm?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/67450d33cc9b2a5a427ffe18bdba5e33.mp4?t=1763516397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust scene visuals like lighting, Sun brightness, bloom, saturation, and posterization. Ambient background music, sound effects, and narration each have their own volume and mute controls.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088620?t=1763516397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/9f71b868cdd2037ffd072fe43191ce3b260c449e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763516397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/f33ca027dd270b8efb1698dc26add7a25d25b5a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763516397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/f33ca027dd270b8efb1698dc26add7a25d25b5a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763516397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explo